    "text": "01\n:\n34\n:\n55\nSpin ID #1970330373.1\nClose\n\nAll Symbol wins are in DMO\n\n1.20\nDMO\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n15.00\n\n6.00\n\n0.60\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n6.00\n\n3.00\n\n0.45\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n3.00\n\n1.50\n\n0.30\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n3.00\n\n1.50\n\n0.30\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n1.50\n\n0.30\n\n0.15\n\nMULTIPLIER REEL\n\nIn addition to these standard rules, Game also includes the X Multiplier, which can randomly appear on the left side reel. With five possible multipliers (1x, 2x,3x,4x and 5x). any win can be multiplier for even greater rewards.\nX2 - GAMBLE FEATURE\n\nIn the game, players have the opportunity to double their winnings with the X2 Gamble Feature. After a winning spin, players can access the Gamble round by clicking the \u201cX2\u201d button. Once the gamble screen appears, a card in the middle of the screen will flash red and black while face down, indicating that the gamble feature is active. To double their winnings, players must correctly guess the color of the card that will be revealed next. If they succeed, their winnings will be doubled. However if the guess incorrectly, their original win will be lost. At any point, players can use the \u201cTake Win\u201d button to collect their winnings and add them to their main balance.\nRED\nBLACK\nTAKE WIN\n2X\nGamble your winnings\n\nAUTO SPIN\nAuto play mode\n\nTURBO\nPlay in turbo mode\n\nHOLD & SPIN\nStart the game\n\nCHOOSE BET\n\nChange bet value and open the bet menu\nCOLLECT\nCollect your winnings\n\n100,000\nDMO\nBALANCE\nUser's current amount\n\n1000\nDMO\nBET\nUser's bet amount\n\nMENU\nGame menu\n\nSOUND\nSound on/off\n\nOTHER RULES\nPayline Chart\nAll symbols pay from the left to righ on adjacent reels starting from the leftmost reel. Highest payline wins are only paid. Line wins are multiplied by the bet value on the winning line.\nGame RTP Rules\n\nMIN BET : 0.40 DMO\nMAX BET : 100.00 DMO\nMAX X : 2500 X\n\nThe Game\u2019s RTP is : 96.58%\nGame Version v1.0.0\nDisconnection\n\nIn the event of a disconnection during gameplay, all accepted bets will still be played out, and any resulting wins will be credited to the player's balance at the end of the round. Please note that after a disconnection, autoplay mode will be switched off to ensure a fair and enjoyable gaming experience. It is important to note that any malfunction will void all plays and payouts, and any unfinished round will be terminated.\n\nPlease note that after a disconnection, Autoplay mode will be switched off to ensure a fair gaming experience.\nIt\u2019s important to note that any malfunction will void all plays and payouts, and any unfinished round will be terminated.\n\nWhen you hit a winning combination, you have three options to credit the win amount to your balance: you can start a new spin by clicking the spin button, Use the take win button to transfer the win to your balance, or use the X2 Double up feature button and clickt take win. If you are playing in AutoPlay mode, all wins are automatically transferred to your balance.\nRules",
